ve either of the Seldon Crises he lives through, he at most applies a nudge to the historic forces already arrayed to sort it out. The Second Foundation spends a lot of it's effort basically using mob psychology to predict how societies will react to events or information. You could spin this out so that the PCs, and even the Psi Orders, aren't going to be the ones to personally solve the threats to humanity, but they'll get nudged by the right events to nudge the right people who'll nudge the right people in a chain lasting for millions of links until everything is aligned.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:blue\">Blue is sarcasm.</span><br /> <br /> If I suggestion I make contradicts in-setting metaphysics please ignore me, I probably brought in scientific ideas.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4507-twodsix","name":"TwoDSix","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-01T10:38:04-07:00","id":1521821,"title":"","content":"Nice sum-up why S02 of Foundation TV series can be great inspiration for Telepath Aptitude! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AOseA0OExFg\" target=\"_blank\"> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AOseA0OExFg\" data-code=\"AOseA0OExFg\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/AOseA0OExFg/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=